.TH LEANDRO 1 "November 2026" "Alicante, Spain" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
leandro \- backend engineer, measures things
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B leandro
.RI [ idea " ...]"
.SH DESCRIPTION
Writes backend code at Luzia, mostly in Python.
.PP
Given an
.IR idea ,
.B leandro
instruments it, waits a few weeks and reports whether it was worth doing.
With no arguments, adds a sensor to something nearby.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The idea was worth it.
.TP
.B 1
The idea was not worth it and a graph was produced.
This is the common case and is not an error.
